### ✅ 204 — removes the second item from the template (no response body)
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/templates/{{createTemplate.response.body.id}}/items/{{createItemTwo.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### ❌ 404 — already removed
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/templates/{{createTemplate.response.body.id}}/items/{{createItemTwo.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### ❌ 404 — template does not exist
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/templates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/items/{{createItem.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### ❌ 400 — invalid itemId (not a UUID)
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/templates/{{createTemplate.response.body.id}}/items/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### 🔒 401 — no token
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/templates/{{createTemplate.response.body.id}}/items/{{createItem.response.body.id}}


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  Cleanup — items can't be deleted while attached to a template
#  (DELETE /items/:id returns 409 if ItemIsInUse), so remove the remaining
#  template item first, then the template, then the items, then the category.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### 204 — remove the last item from the template
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/templates/{{createTemplate.response.body.id}}/items/{{createItem.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### 204 — delete the template
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/templates/{{createTemplate.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### 204 — delete item one
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/items/{{createItem.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### 204 — delete item two
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/items/{{createItemTwo.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### 204 — delete the category
DELETE http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/categories/{{createCategory.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}
